<description>&lt;p&gt;Intercommunal clashes in Rumbek have killed at least 71 people, including soldiers, and prompted the caretaker governor Rin Tueny to return to Lakes State. The violence follows the killing of the Akobo commissioner by unknown assailants and the sentencing of a soldier to ten years for murdering a UN worker. A drone strike by the RSF killed 41 people in Sudan's Blue Nile region, a development mentioned alongside the South Sudan clashes. The conflict now shows a sharp increase in lethal communal violence compared with the two battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPaUU0ZkpMWXVnTktFVWJRUnFBM1dvTVdYbWQxclRLMHd5d0VQdUJrWW1aV2FCbHpTdHFZX2tab25WTXpRTXVXYktTVXBfV3VKMW8ySFNKOEh1bU1ZOE9RRHRJZ05hci10OGdvNUlYOGMyLVc0UEhmMFlUVEhxNURKTzdGWUs4SjNBZk1XZTJYVGdaZ3JMdjllX2t3?oc=5&quot;&gt;PM News Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNZmMzcTlKNTdqZ1lmZFppZlE0WUtSNlFtalZDZ1JJTzdIRnFPY2phRmZjYzJjQUFuS0EyYnplTEdDeFFObjFmV0RielNib0tmTDNURzAwVUdJQ2p5d3JLMUhOT1daaXl0YmktTnhCRElyYkZTbU5BRUlHeHM2U3ZfejI5LVBTNEdpTUxrUm5oakJMOTUtb1ZndHVUQ2xTTkh1TzZwQ1Bub04zZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;أفريكا نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPd0V1WkVZak5lQUtkdXRVVGhGNHR4alVtTmRndUQtUEl4ZVV4eXpmcDRfVXhLcmRJcG9YR2xINXBZNXk0dm8teXBSX2NBcGdjMUxKN1k1MG9sV3hfZl9yWk9lLVotb2N3blVFRW1ycklUbFNpczBtdDd0aVItNk5saUxUeERyMnFoMHFudTBFeEJtQ3RTN0pETjdfNVI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;